&lt;p>原文：&lt;a href="https://go-chi.io/#/pages/routing">https://go-chi.io/#/pages/routing&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&lt;/blockquote>
&lt;h1 id="-routing--路由">🔌 Routing 🔌 路由&lt;a class="td-heading-self-link" href="#-routing--%e8%b7%af%e7%94%b1" aria-label="Heading self-link">&lt;/a>&lt;/h1>
&lt;h2 id="introduction-简介">Introduction 简介&lt;a class="td-heading-self-link" href="#introduction-%e7%ae%80%e4%bb%8b" aria-label="Heading self-link">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>
&lt;blockquote>
&lt;p>Routing refers to how an application&amp;rsquo;s endpoints (URIs) respond to client requests.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>​	路由是指应用程序的端点 (URI) 如何响应客户端请求。&lt;/p>&lt;/blockquote>
&lt;p>&lt;code>Chi&lt;/code> allows you to route/handle any HTTP request method, such as all the usual suspects: GET, POST, HEAD, PUT, PATCH, DELETE, OPTIONS, TRACE, CONNECT&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>